  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xg6efto0o7_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>合同嗖嗖，用AI对话方式生成合同 <a href=\"https://contract.yoo-ai.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://contract.yoo-ai.com/</a>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xg6efto0o7_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xg6efto0o7_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xg6efto0o7_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个营销风险日历，就可以用我上次说的这个开源日历制作出来一个线上版本。</div>\n<div>我们之前分享过的rentry.co 域名权重还是挺高的，人人都可以创建一个完全自定义内容的页面，可以尝试一下，是否可以用这个域名来获取某些新词的排名。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xg6efto0o7_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>跟 rentry 有关的一些话题 <a href=\"https://web.cafe/messages/topic/26486\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://web.cafe/messages/topic/26486</a> <a href=\"https://web.cafe/messages/topic/26521\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://web.cafe/messages/topic/26521</a> <a href=\"https://web.cafe/messages/topic/27502\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://web.cafe/messages/topic/27502</a> <a href=\"https://web.cafe/messages/topic/58969\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://web.cafe/messages/topic/58969</a> <a href=\"https://web.cafe/messages/topic/128060\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://web.cafe/messages/topic/128060</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/xg6efto0o7_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>neilpatel.com 的网站，最近六个月流量也是一直在下降，不知道发生了什么。</div>\n<div>运维能用上的开源项目，目前收录了414个项目 <a href=\"https://github.com/eryajf/awesome-ops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/eryajf/awesome-ops</a></div>",
